{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-07-11 19:40:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES SURPRISES EMPLOYEES WITH 90,000 MILES TO TRAVEL THE GLOBE', 'text': 'ALASKA AIRLINES IS CELEBRATING ITS 90TH ANNIVERSARY BY GIVING ALL EMPLOYEES THE GIFT OF TRAVEL. SEATTLE , JULY 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHILE MANY OF US WERE INSTRUCTED TO STAY HOME DURING THE PANDEMIC, AIRLINE EMPLOYEES WERE PART OF THE ESSENTIAL WORKFORCE WHO REMAINED ON THE FRONT LINES.'}